[node name="SaintsDaysBook" type="Area2D" parent="Parts"]
visible = false
position = Vector2(300, 230)
script = ExtResource("story_item")
interaction_name = "Open the book of saints' days"
enabled = false
discovery_text = "[b]A book of saints' days[/b]

The dullest book in the aumbry, a calendar of feasts in a plain hand. The binding is too thick for the boards. Cut along the spine, and folded inside it are letters: Brackenmoor's salt letters, a second set, who bought the deep-vein salt in the Grey Year and who sold it, and behind them a fair copy of the receipt in Brother Anselm's hand."
reexamine_text = "The saints' days book, its spine cut open."

